son" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-114250" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "543a47ee29201caea3d4fe4078ab9f2433b6e634fd1408c35864fe779760c0f4"} {"question" "q-114250" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-114250" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{\\pi }{2}"] ["math" "-{\\pi }^{2}"] ["math" "2{\\pi }^{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{2}"] ["math" "{\\pi }^{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-114250" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\pi }^{2}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-115516" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4x}{x}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-115516" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here the limits of the numerator and denominator are ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\operatorname{ln}⁡4x=\\infty $ and ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }x=\\infty ,$ respectively, so we have the case $\\frac{\\infty }{\\infty }.$\n\nApplying L'Hopital's rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4x}{x} & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{[\\operatorname{ln}⁡4x]^{′}}{{[x]}^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(\\frac{1}{x})}{1} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{1}{x} \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-115516" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "543a47ee29201caea3d4fe4078ab9f2433b6e634fd1408c35864fe779760c0f4"} {"question" "q-115516" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-115516" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-4"] ["math" "-\\infty "] ["math" "0"] ["math" "4"] ["math" "\\infty "]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-115516" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-115526" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}{\\operatorname{cot}⁡x}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"question" "q-115526" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here the limits of the numerator and denominator are ${lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)=-\\infty $ and ${lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}\\operatorname{cot}⁡x=\\infty ,$ respectively, so we have the case $\\frac{-\\infty }{\\infty }.$\n\nApplying L'Hopital's rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}{\\operatorname{cot}⁡x} & ={lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}\\frac{{[\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)]}^{′}}{[\\operatorname{cot}⁡x]^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}\\frac{(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x})}{-{csc}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}\\frac{(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x})}{(\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x})} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x{sin}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to {0}^{+}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡0\\operatorname{sin}⁡0 \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068434/state.json" "file_sha256" "eba99a830e7033b322eceba6d91f900c953b715de77ce127a84e5a961e57bae8"} {"ques